### 题目管理接口测试

### 1. 创建题目
POST http://localhost:8083/api/practice/question/create
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "courseId": 1,
  "title": "什么是Java？",
  "type": "单选题",
  "options": ["编程语言", "数据库", "操作系统", "硬件"],
  "answer": "编程语言",
  "analysis": "Java是一种广泛使用的编程语言"
}

### 2. 更新题目
PUT http://localhost:8083/api/practice/question/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "courseId": 1,
  "title": "什么是Java（更新版）？",
  "type": "单选题",
  "options": ["编程语言", "数据库", "操作系统", "硬件"],
  "answer": "编程语言",
  "analysis": "Java是一种广泛使用的面向对象编程语言"
}

### 3. 获取题目列表（全部）
GET http://localhost:8083/api/practice/question/list

### 4. 获取题目列表（按课程筛选）
GET http://localhost:8083/api/practice/question/list?courseId=1

### 5. 获取题目详情
GET http://localhost:8083/api/practice/question/1

### 6. 删除题目
DELETE http://localhost:8083/api/practice/question/1

### 7. 导入题目到练习
POST http://localhost:8083/api/practice/question/import
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "practiceId": 1001,
  "questionIds": [1, 2, 3],
  "scores": [10, 15, 20]
}

### 8. 按章节获取题目
GET http://localhost:8083/api/practice/question/section?courseId=1&sectionId=1

### 9. 批量创建题目
POST http://localhost:8083/api/practice/question/batch
Content-Type: application/json

[
  {
    "courseId": 1,
    "title": "什么是Python？",
    "type": "单选题",
    "options": ["编程语言", "数据库", "操作系统", "硬件"],
    "answer": "编程语言",
    "analysis": "Python是一种流行的高级编程语言"
  },
  {
    "courseId": 1,
    "title": "什么是JavaScript？",
    "type": "单选题",
    "options": ["编程语言", "数据库", "操作系统", "硬件"],
    "answer": "编程语言",
    "analysis": "JavaScript是一种广泛使用的网页脚本语言"
  }
]
